<title>FRANCE: AGF H1 net attrib profit rises.</title>
<headline>AGF H1 net attrib profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     723  vs	     487</p>
<p>    Net earnings before exceptionals	 723  vs	   489</p>
<p>Net earnings before exceptionals</p>
<p>    and goodwill				   895  vs	   715</p>
<p>    Life insurance France			131  vs	   344</p>
<p>    Non-life insurance France		  364  vs	   326</p>
<p>    Insurance outside France		   423  vs	   213</p>
<p>    Reinsurance				     96  vs	   107</p>
<p>    Credit insurance			     159  vs	   175</p>
<p>    Banking, finance loss			346  vs   loss  203</p>
<p>    Holdings and property companies loss   104  vs   loss  473</p>
<p>NOTE - Assurances Generales de France gave the results in a statement</p>
</text>
